  "summary": "How to discover, configure, view, and review footage from NVRs and cameras.",
  "sections": {
    "body": "<h2>Overview</h2>\n<p>NVRs & Cameras manages video surveillance devices across five tabs: <strong>Live Video Matrix</strong>, <strong>NVR Playback Center</strong>, <strong>Discovery Protocol</strong>, <strong>Config Server</strong>, and <strong>Event Log</strong>.</p>\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 758 74\" width=\"758\" height=\"74\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Discover Devices then Configure &amp;\nTest Connection then View Live / PTZ then Review Playback\n&amp; Events\">\n<defs><marker id=\"arrow-8\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"var(--color-text-muted)\"/></marker></defs>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"12\" width=\"158\" height=\"50\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"var(--color-primary-soft)\" stroke=\"var(--color-primary)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n    <text text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"var(--color-text)\"><tspan x=\"91\" y=\"41\">Discover Devices</tspan></text><rect x=\"204\" y=\"12\" width=\"158\" height=\"50\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"var(--color-primary-soft)\" stroke=\"var(--color-primary)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n    <text text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"var(--color-text)\"><tspan x=\"283\" y=\"34\">Configure &amp;</tspan><tspan x=\"283\" y=\"48\">Test Connection</tspan></text><rect x=\"396\" y=\"12\" width=\"158\" height=\"50\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"var(--color-primary-soft)\" stroke=\"var(--color-primary)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n    <text text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"var(--color-text)\"><tspan x=\"475\" y=\"41\">View Live / PTZ</tspan></text><rect x=\"588\" y=\"12\" width=\"158\" height=\"50\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"var(--color-primary-soft)\" stroke=\"var(--color-primary)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n    <text text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"var(--color-text)\"><tspan x=\"667\" y=\"34\">Review Playback</tspan><tspan x=\"667\" y=\"48\">&amp; Events</tspan></text><line x1=\"174\" y1=\"37\" x2=\"197\" y2=\"37\" stroke=\"var(--color-text-muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-8)\"/><line x1=\"366\" y1=\"37\" x2=\"389\" y2=\"37\" stroke=\"var(--color-text-muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-8)\"/><line x1=\"558\" y1=\"37\" x2=\"581\" y2=\"37\" stroke=\"var(--color-text-muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-8)\"/>\n</svg>\n<h2>Key Features</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>Discovery Protocol</strong> — finds NVRs/cameras on the network via ONVIF and Hikvision ISAPI.</li><li><strong>Config Server</strong> — add a discovered device and test its connection before relying on it.</li><li><strong>Live Video Matrix</strong> — a configurable grid of live feeds with an embedded PTZ alignment panel.</li><li><strong>NVR Playback Center</strong> — review recorded footage.</li><li><strong>Event Log</strong> — motion-detection and other alert history.</li></ul>\n<h2>Step-by-Step</h2>\n<ol><li>Run <strong>Discovery Protocol</strong> to find devices on the network.</li><li>Add a discovered device in <strong>Config Server</strong> and test its connection.</li><li>Open <strong>Live Video Matrix</strong> to view feeds; use the PTZ panel to pan/tilt/zoom supported cameras.</li><li>Use <strong>NVR Playback Center</strong> to review recordings, and <strong>Event Log</strong> to review motion alerts.</li></ol>\n<h2>Tips</h2>\n<ul><li>Your grid layout and camera selection in Live Video Matrix are saved per user, so they're waiting for you next time.</li></ul>"
  },
